<!-- Hunters' Accord's trophy ranks: our own diamond seals (design v9, card TrBadges), not cups; 48x48 each.
     Bronze one stone, silver three, gold five, platinum moon-silver with a double rim and the Accord's arch with a blood
     stone; *Locked the same in stone; Hidden an empty diamond with "?". The metals: .notes design trophies.md. -->
